WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.206
Today we will use art to communicate a helpful message. Our work connects with

00:00:05.206 --> 00:00:07.709
international artists and communities around the world.

00:00:08.533 --> 00:00:11.243
Choose one clear message about a community need.

00:00:12.533 --> 00:00:15.008
Draw a bold image that supports the message.

00:00:16.533 --> 00:00:21.752
Add a few large readable words and check the layout. Justify a revision using

00:00:21.752 --> 00:00:23.616
evidence from another world tradition.
